{"unit_id":"yezisorft__dsh-netease-island#card-zh","repo":"yezisorft/dsh-netease-island","commit":"6a5a01d4ad9fb470c32e965c597b233c2797d599","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-netease-island 是面向 DSH 桌面界面的 Windows 媒体播放挂件。它通过系统 SMTC 媒体会话读取正在播放内容，并将播放状态送到页面顶部的灵动岛胶囊中。展开挂件可查看封面、歌名、歌手和进度，并进行播放暂停、上一首、下一首和进度跳转。适合希望在 DSH 窗口内查看或控制本机音乐的 Windows 用户；需要 Windows PowerShell 5.1 和播放器提供 SMTC 会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:465-549","lib/client.js:365-385","lib/smtc-bridge.ps1:230-280"]}
{"unit_id":"yezisorft__dsh-netease-island#card-en","repo":"yezisorft/dsh-netease-island","commit":"6a5a01d4ad9fb470c32e965c597b233c2797d599","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-netease-island adds a Windows media widget to DSH. It reads the system SMTC session through a PowerShell bridge and shows artwork, track, artist and progress in a capsule. Expand it to play or pause, skip tracks, or seek. Requires Windows PowerShell 5.1 and a player that exposes an SMTC session.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:465-549","lib/client.js:365-385","lib/smtc-bridge.ps1:230-280"]}
